{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02418","headline":"新曲二首 二 · 长孙无忌","name":"新曲二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回雪凌波游洛浦，遇陈王。\n婉约娉婷工语笑，侍兰房。\n芙蓉绮帐还开揜，翡翠珠被烂齐光。\n长愿今宵奉颜色，不爱吹箫逐凤皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙无忌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}